      Upper bound on the mini player width, so it stays a *mini* player on a large window.
      This cap and the 0.7 width ratio cross at 380 / 0.7 = 542.9dp, where both yield the same
      width; below that the ratio is the smaller of the two and wins, which is why a phone needs
      no window-size branch anywhere.
